  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 19 November 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nThe Victor, where beachfront living meets modern sophistication in the vibrant heart of Browns Bay. This is your opportunity to enjoy an unparalleled way of life, fresh ocean air, and thoughtfully designed spaces that reflect contemporary elegance. With its prime location and state-of-the art amenities, The Victor offers the perfect balance of relaxation and refined living.\r\n\r\nThis luxurious one-bedroom apartment has been tailored for the discerning professional or couple seeking a stylish, low-maintenance haven. Wake up and unwind in beautifully appointed contemporary interiors and enjoy the peace of mind that comes with an easy lock-and-leave lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe apartment has a generously sized bedroom and a well-appointed bathroom, complemented by a spacious layout that flows seamlessly onto a private balcony. —ideal for soaking up the coastal atmosphere.+\r\n\r\nA smart investment and lifestyle choice.",
